# AI Usage Log - Sprint 2

Task 1: Local Environment and MySQL Database Verification
Purpose of AI Use: Project setup assistance (Homebrew download, MySQL server initialization, running Node.js server)
Conversation ID (Antigravity - Google DeepMind): 5b928df4-8a80-4f48-ac58-09c06a6db2a3
AI-Suggested Content: 
- Commands to install and start MySQL via Homebrew.
- Instructions to supply database credentials via terminal environment variables without altering teammates files.
Validation: Successfully downloaded Homebrew, verified the database connection, and loaded the server.
Decision: Accepted
Reflection: AI gave very detailed instructions for downloading Homebrew and starting MySQL. However, it initially changed documents without me realizing. So I told AI to always verify changes with me before implementation.
Responsible Person: Tasneem Sultana Chowdhury

Task 2: Elevate Existing Job Details Page

Task 2.1: UI design suggestions for job details page
Purpose of AI Use: UI/UX design suggestions to change current Job Postings Page.
Chat Link (ChatGPT): https://chatgpt.com/share/6adf8914-8b00-83e9-8c01-8b7cfe70e7c6
AI-Suggested Content: Suggested UI/UX changes to bring to the current Job Posting Page. Created a final version to implement to the page.
Validation: I liked the ASHBY style in point "02 - Refine the application form". Successfully implemented an improved UI for the job postings page by taking inspiration from ChatGPT's suggestions.
Decision: Modified before use (Modified using antigravity in task 2.2).
